msgid "Art Revision Control (using GIT)"
msgstr "Konstversionskontroll (använder GIT)"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:290
msgid "Way to use Version Control systems for artwork."
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources_page.rst:292
msgid "Available here: https://github.com/abeimler/krita-plugin-durra"
msgstr "Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/abeimler/krita-plugin-durra"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:295
msgid "Bash Action (works with OSX and Linux)"
msgstr "Bash-åtgärd (fungerar med OSX och Linux)"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:297
msgid ""
"Plugin to execute Bash commands and programs as Actions on your current "
"Images from Krita."
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources_page.rst:299
msgid ""
"Available here: https://github.com/juancarlospaco/krita-plugin-"
"bashactions#krita-plugin-bashactions"
msgstr ""
"Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/juancarlospaco/krita-plugin-"
"bashactions#krita-plugin-bashactions"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:302
msgid "Direct Eraser Plugin"
msgstr "Insticksprogram för direktradering"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:304
msgid ""
"Lets you create a shortcut for the eraser and brush that doesn't depend on "
"state. In other words, pressing the eraser shortcut always sets you up with "
"the brush in eraser mode, no toggling, no selecting the brush first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources_page.rst:306
msgid ""
"Available here: https://www.mediafire.com/file/sotzc2keogz0bor/Krita+Direct"
"+Eraser+Plugin.zip"
msgstr ""
"Tillgänglig här: https://www.mediafire.com/file/sotzc2keogz0bor/Krita+Direct"
"+Eraser+Plugin.zip"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:309
msgid "Krita Plugin Generator"
msgstr "Krita insticksgenerator"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:310
