msgstr "Skapa en insticksprogrammall för Krita."

#: ../../resources_page.rst:312
msgid "Available here: https://github.com/cg-cnu/vscode-krita-plugin-generator"
msgstr ""
"Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/cg-cnu/vscode-krita-plugin-generator"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:315
msgid "Mirror Fix"
msgstr "Speglingsfix"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:317
msgid ""
"Allows more flexibility when mirroring, with different orientations, and "
"selections."
msgstr ""

