#: ../../resources_page.rst:329
msgid "Pigment.O"
msgstr "Pigment.O"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:331
msgid "Available here: https://github.com/EyeOdin/Pigment.O"
msgstr "Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/EyeOdin/Pigment.O"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:334
msgid "Post images on Mastodon"
msgstr "Skicka in bilder till Mastodon"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:336
msgid ""
"A plugin that lets you post a copy of your current document directly to "
"Mastodon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources_page.rst:338
msgid "Available here: https://github.com/spaceottercode/kritatoot"
msgstr "Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/spaceottercode/kritatoot"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:341
msgid "Python auto-complete for text editors"
msgstr "Automatisk komplettering av Python för texteditorer"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:343
msgid ""
"If you have the Krita source code, you can use this to generate the auto-"
"complete file for Python. Many Python editors need a :file:`.PY` file to "
"read for auto-complete information. This script reads the C++ header files "
"and creates a Python file that can be used for auto-completion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources_page.rst:345
msgid ""
"Available here: https://github.com/scottpetrovic/krita-python-auto-complete"
msgstr ""
"Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/scottpetrovic/krita-python-auto-complete"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:349
msgid "QuickColor"
msgstr "Snabbfärg"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:351
msgid "Enables the user to swap between predefined colors by using hotkeys."
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources_page.rst:353
msgid "Available here: https://github.com/JonasLW/QuickColor"
msgstr "Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/JonasLW/QuickColor"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:357
msgid "Reference Image Docker (old style)"
msgstr "Referensbildpanel (gammal stil)"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:358
msgid ""
"After activating the docker, click on Open and choose an image. Beware, no "
"verification is done on the format... You've been warned! After that you can "
"move the reference, zoom or pick a color."
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources_page.rst:360
msgid "Available here: https://github.com/antoine-roux/krita-plugin-reference"
msgstr ""
"Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/antoine-roux/krita-plugin-reference"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:363
msgid "Spine File Format Export"
msgstr "Spline-filformatexport"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:365
msgid ""
"Inspired by the official Photoshop Plugin, it works nearly the same. Click "
"on :menuselection:`Tools --> Scripts --> Export to Spine`, select a folder "
"and all your images will be exported into it as well as :file:`spine.json`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources_page.rst:367
msgid ""
"Available here: https://github.com/chartinger/krita-unofficial-spine-export"
msgstr ""
"Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/chartinger/krita-unofficial-spine-export"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:370
msgid "Subwindow Organizer"
msgstr "Delfönsterorganisering"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:372
msgid ""
"Helps with handling multiple documents in subwindow mode. Introduces "
"responsive fullscreen with other subwindows opened, dynamic snapping of "
"subwindows to canvas borders, drag and drop switching between subwindows, "
"and more."
msgstr ""
"Hjälper till att hantera flera dokument i delfönsterläge. Introducerar"
" responsiv fullskärm med andra delfönster öppnade, dynamisk låsning av"
" delfönster till dukkanter, byte mellan delfönster med dra och släpp, med"
" mera."

#: ../../resources_page.rst:374
#| msgid "https://github.com/wojtryb/kritaSubwindowOrganizer"
msgid "Available here: https://github.com/wojtryb/kritaSubwindowOrganizer"
msgstr "Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/wojtryb/kritaSubwindowOrganizer"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:377
msgid "Tablet Controls Docker"
msgstr "Kontrollpanel för rItplatta"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:379
msgid "Available Here: https://github.com/tokyogeometry/tabui"
msgstr "Tillgänglig här: https://github.com/tokyogeometry/tabui"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:382
msgid "ThreeSlots"
msgstr "Tre platser"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:384
msgid ""
"Creates three brush tool shortcuts that memorize last used brush preset for "
"each slot independently from each other."
msgstr ""
"Skapar tre genvägar till penselverktyg som kommer ihåg de senast använda "
"förinställningarna för varje plats oberoende av varandra."

#: ../../resources_page.rst:386
msgid "Available here: https://github.com/DarkDefender/threeslots"
msgstr "Tillgängligt här: https://github.com/DarkDefender/threeslots"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:389
msgid "Timer Watch"
msgstr "Tidsövervakning"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:391
msgid ""
"Allows you to check the time progress, start and pause if you want to take a "
"break, and even do alarms."
msgstr ""

